                   </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/sencolle5__117.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                                <p>ハロウィン</p>\n                            </td>\n                            <td>設定6濃厚</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n                <p>7揃い時は下記の1枚絵が出現すれば、特定設定以上濃厚となります。</p>\n                <h4>1枚絵の設定示唆パターン出現率</h4>\n                <table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th>設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width: 26.6%;\">和服2人</th>\n                            <th style=\"width: 26.6%;\">クリスマス</th>\n                            <th style=\"width: 26.6%;\">ハロウィン</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>ー</td>\n                            <td rowspan=\"3\">ー</td>\n                            <td rowspan=\"5\">ー</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>約5％</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定3</td>\n                            <td>約5％</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定4</td>\n                            <td>約2.5％</td>\n                            <td>約2.5％</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>約2.5％</td>\n                            <td>約2.5％</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>約2.5％</td>\n                            <td>約1.3％</td>\n                       